<title>THAILAND: Thai 1997 soymeal demand seen 1.7 mln T -- industry.</title>
<headline>Thai 1997 soymeal demand seen 1.7 mln T -- industry.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's animal feed industry projects soymeal demand for 1997 could reach 1.7 million tonnes from 1.3-1.4 million tonnes expected this year, industry sources told Reuters on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Only about 250,000 tonnes of soymeal is forecast to be produced from local beans, according to the sources.</p>
<p>Some more will be extracted from 600,000 tonnes of soybeans expected to be imported next year and the rest will be directly imported as soymeal.</p>
<p>The forecast was made during a meeting on Monday among feed producers and other authorised importers of feed ingredients, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
